# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": any line may use any name the block binds, and the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (the query answers at the build, by the element as built) and Type System ch. 1: loud gives 10, so the count is "count 10", answered 5, the label "5 5" and the arm's label 2; soft gives 20, answered 6, and builds nothing in its arm. Never run: prismc refuses the program.
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="5 5")
    1: Pad.Count(name="count 10")
    2: Ui.Label(text="loud")

test soft

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="6 6")
    1: Pad.Count(name="count 20")
